    "description": {
      "value": "These sturdy leather sandals feature straps that wrap up to the knees. Etched in the leather are intricate patterns of stags leaping through the forest. You gain a +5-foot item bonus to your land Speed and a +3 item bonus on Athletics checks when attempting to High Jump or Long Jump. When you invest the sandals, you either increase your Strength score by 2 or increase it to 18, whichever is higher.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n- **Trigger:** You attempt a High Jump or Long Jump but you didn't Stride at least 10 feet\n\nYou can attempt the jump normally. It doesn't automatically fail."
    },
